message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Hand-care product specifications as stated by manufacturers: heated hand massagers and adjacent products (Oct 2026)"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Erin
    given-names: Muhammed Veysel
    affiliation: Wearmelly
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-19
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://wearmelly.com"
abstract: "A table of what 19 manufacturers state on their own web pages about their products and return terms: 11 heated hand massagers plus 8 adjacent hand and wrist products (3 compression gloves, 3 wrist braces, 2 paraffin baths). 41 fields per model (heat, battery, auto shut-off, charging, controls, price, return window, return shipping, restocking fee, warranty and more), each cell marked stated, not-stated, conflict or inaccessible and backed by a verbatim quote from the manufacturer's page. Pages were read on 2026-10-18. Claims quoted are the manufacturers', not ours. This dataset makes no medical claims. Compiled by Wearmelly (wearmelly.com), which sells Melly, a heated hand massager not included in this dataset."
keywords:
  - heated hand massager
  - hand massager
  - manufacturer specifications
  - product data
  - return policy
  - warranty
  - consumer products
  - open data
